SRC_DNODE_RPC_3: DRpc = DRpc(module='kea-dhcp4', namespace='http://stratoweave.org/yang/kea-dhcp4', prefix='kea4', name='stat-lease4-get', description="Read the pool use of each subnet. An onboarding pool that runs\nout of addresses makes ZTP fail without a message. Devices boot,\nask for an address, and receive nothing. These counters show that\nfailure.\n\nThis command comes from the 'stat_cmds' hook library.\n\nDIVERGENCE: Kea returns a table and not a list of records. The\nreply holds 'result-set' with a 'columns' array and a 'rows' array\nof arrays. YANG has no list of lists. The adapter therefore joins\neach row to the column names and builds the list below.", if_feature=[
'statistics-commands'
    ], input=DInput(module='kea-dhcp4', namespace='http://stratoweave.org/yang/kea-dhcp4', prefix='kea4', children=[
    DLeaf(module='kea-dhcp4', namespace='http://stratoweave.org/yang/kea-dhcp4', prefix='kea4', name='subnet-id', config=False, description='Read this subnet only. Kea reads all subnets when this leaf\nis absent.', mandatory=False, type=DTypeIntegerUnsigned(name='uint32', description=None, reference=None, exts=[], builtin_type='uint32', default=None, ranges=Ranges([(0, 4294967295)])))
